# Generated data files (gitignored — run scripts to populate)
#
#   dnd5e_srd.json         — run: python3 scripts/provision_srd.py
#   dnd5e_supplemental.json — run: python3 systems/dnd5e/build_supplemental.py
#
# Both files are excluded from version control. They may be large and contain
# content under separate licensing terms. Generate them locally before use.
#
# Use `scripts/provision_srd.py` rather than `build_srd.py` directly. It builds
# the dataset and then checks it, because `build_srd.py` writes its output unless
# *every* category came back empty: one refused fetch from foundryvtt/dnd5e
# produces a complete-looking file with no class or racial features in it, and
# exit 0. That dataset makes the test suite green by running less of itself.
# `python3 scripts/provision_srd.py --check` verifies what is already here without
# touching the network. See dnd-gm#289.
